-- lodged on 16 March: late
#ASSERT `Under section 63A(1), is the public company late in lodging the return of the allotment` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 16 3 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
