-- the statement was made for another proposal, not this redemption: barred
#ASSERT `Under section 70(4), is the company barred from redeeming the shares out of capital` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE 3 3 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the directors intend to wind up within 12 months but the statement gives only the opinion for a going concern: not a solvency statement, barred
