-- no notice lodged: the grant is not used
#ASSERT `Under section 70(6), may the private company redeem the shares by lodging the notice` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- redemption on 5 March 2016 and the register is not yet updated: not yet in effect
