#ASSERT `Under section 70(8), is the public company in default of the duty to give notice to the Registrar of the redemption` FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
