#ASSERT `Under section 76(1), is the company one the subsection binds` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A private company with no public holding company: the subsection says nothing of it (a case the text does not reach).
#ASSERT `Under section 76(1), is the company one the subsection binds` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
