#ASSERT `Under section 76(1)(b), is the proposed acquisition one that paragraph (b) names` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Section 76(1A): Acme Ltd buys its own shares. Arguments: what the company did; an exception applies; (17) applies.
