#ASSERT `Under section 211(3), must the company furnish me with a copy of the statement free of charge` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 211(3), must the company furnish me with a copy of the statement free of charge` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Under section 211(4), did the director or trustee give notice within 7 days of the receipt of the request?
