#ASSERT `Under section 211(4), did the director or trustee give notice within 7 days of the receipt of the request` (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 8 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Under section 211(5), is the company guilty of the offence?
-- (5): the company
#ASSERT `Under section 211(5), is the company guilty of the offence` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 211(5), is the company guilty of the offence` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Under section 211(6), am I deemed to be an officer of the company for subsection (5)?
