#ASSERT `Under section 8C(1) and (2), is the copy or extract admissible in evidence as if it were the original book or the relevant part of it` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "a copy of or extract from a book relating to the affairs of a corporation is admissible in evidence as if it were the original book"
#ASSERT `Under section 8C(1) and (2), is the copy or extract admissible in evidence as if it were the original book or the relevant part of it` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "is not admissible in evidence under subsection (1) unless it is proved that the copy or extract is a true copy"
