#ASSERT `Under section 8D(1), am I guilty of the offence of destroying, mutilating or falsifying a company document, or making a false entry in it` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- destroys, mutilates or falsifies, with no proof of innocent intention
