#ASSERT `Under section 8D(1), am I guilty of the offence of destroying, mutilating or falsifying a company document, or making a false entry in it` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- did none of the acts: an element is unmet

