#ASSERT `Under section 8D(2), am I guilty of the offence of fraudulently parting with, altering or making an omission in a company document` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "A person to whom subsection (1) applies who fraudulently either parts with, alters or makes an omission in any such document"
