-- Under section 8E, does section 8A compel me, as an advocate and solicitor, to produce the document
#ASSERT `Under section 8E, does section 8A compel me, as an advocate and solicitor, to produce the document` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "Nothing in sections 8A and 8B compels the production by an advocate and solicitor of a document containing a privileged communication"
