#ASSERT `Under section 8E, am I, as an advocate and solicitor, obliged to give the name and address of the person to whom or by or on behalf of whom the communication was made` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- has not refused: the obligation is gated by the refusal ("if the advocate and solicitor refuses")
#ASSERT `Under section 8E, am I, as an advocate and solicitor, obliged to give the name and address of the person to whom or by or on behalf of whom the communication was made` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- neither

