#ASSERT `Under section 12D(2)(b), what is the earliest date that may be stated for delivering a written objection` (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS Date 31 3 2025   -- "at least 30 days after the date of the notice": 1 March plus 30 days is 31 March
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(2)(b), what is the earliest date that may be stated for delivering a written objection` (Date 31 1 2025) EQUALS Date 2 3 2025   -- 31 January plus 30 days is 2 March (28 days in February 2025)

