#ASSERT `Under section 12D(3), may I deliver a written objection to the proposed rectification or updating` TRUE (Date 31 3 2025) (Date 31 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "not later than the date specified": delivered on the date specified
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(3), may I deliver a written objection to the proposed rectification or updating` TRUE (Date 20 3 2025) (Date 31 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- delivered before it
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(3), may I deliver a written objection to the proposed rectification or updating` TRUE (Date 1 4 2025) (Date 31 3 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- one day late: a period the text fixes in its own words (periods ruling (a))
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(3), may I deliver a written objection to the proposed rectification or updating` FALSE (Date 20 3 2025) (Date 31 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING   -- a company or person not notified under (2): the text says nothing

-- Under section 12D(4), is the Registrar barred from rectifying or updating the register
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(4), is the Registrar barred from rectifying or updating the register` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "The Registrar must not rectify or update the register if the Registrar receives a written objection under subsection (3) ... by the date specified"
