#ASSERT `Under section 12D(4), is the Registrar barred from rectifying or updating the register` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no objection received by the date: the bar does not arise (a failed "if" of a bar; marginal reading (a))

-- Under section 12D(5), may the Registrar rectify or update the register
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(5), may the Registrar rectify or update the register` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "The Registrar may rectify or update the register if the Registrar does not receive a written objection under subsection (3) by the date specified"
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(5), may the Registrar rectify or update the register` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an objection was received: a failed "if" gating a grant (grant ruling, limit 1); subsection (4) governs

