#ASSERT `Under section 12D(6), may the Registrar include the notation on the register` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "may include such notation as the Registrar thinks fit on the register for the purposes of providing information relating to any error, defect or inaccuracy"
#ASSERT `Under section 12D(6), may the Registrar include the notation on the register` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- a notation for another purpose: the text says nothing

