#ASSERT `Under section 12E(3), must the Registrar cause the exclusion of my residential address from public access to resume` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(a) subject to section 12F(8) ..., notice of a change in the individual's contact address is lodged"
