#ASSERT `Under section 12E(4), must the Registrar cause my residential address to be excluded from public access in respect of the document` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(a) a document is filed or lodged with the Registrar ... by submitting a form on the electronic transaction system on or after the date of commencement ...; and (b) an individual's residential address is entered in that form"
