#ASSERT `Under section 12F(1), does a ground exist for causing my residential address to cease to be excluded from public access` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(a) communications sent by the Registrar ... to the individual at the contact address and requiring a response within a specified period remain unanswered"
