#ASSERT `Under section 12F(2), must the Registrar give the person the notice under subsection (3) before causing my residential address to cease to be excluded` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "(c) every private company of which the Registrar has been notified ... that the individual is a member"
