#ASSERT `Under section 12F(2), must the Registrar give the person the notice under subsection (3) before causing my residential address to cease to be excluded` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the Registrar is not about to do so: the duty is gated by "Before causing"

