§§ `Section 138: the instruments, the register of charges and inspection`

-- Under section 138(1): must the company keep the instrument creating the charge, or a copy, at its registered office.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), must the company keep the instrument creating the charge, or a copy, at its registered office` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), must the company keep the instrument creating the charge, or a copy, at its registered office` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- the charge is no longer in force
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), must the company keep the instrument creating the charge, or a copy, at its registered office` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING      -- a charge not requiring registration

-- Under section 138(1): does the company's keeping satisfy the subsection.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), does the company's keeping satisfy the subsection` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), does the company's keeping satisfy the subsection` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- a series: a copy of one debenture is enough
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), does the company's keeping satisfy the subsection` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- a copy of one debenture is enough only for a series

-- Under section 138(2): which particulars must the company give of each charge in its register of charges.
#ASSERT count (`Under section 138(2), which particulars must the company give of each charge in its register of charges` FALSE) EQUALS 3      -- three particulars
#ASSERT count (`Under section 138(2), which particulars must the company give of each charge in its register of charges` TRUE) EQUALS 2      -- "except in the case of securities to bearer": two

-- Under section 138(3): must the item be open to my inspection.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), must the item be open to my inspection` `s 138(3) a creditor of the company` `s 138(3) the instruments or copies kept under section 138` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- a creditor
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), must the item be open to my inspection` `s 138(3) any other person` `s 138(3) the register of charges` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- any other person: the register
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), must the item be open to my inspection` `s 138(3) any other person` `s 138(3) the instruments or copies kept under section 138` EQUALS NOTHING      -- any other person: the instruments

-- Under section 138(3): what is the most the company may charge me for one inspection, in Singapore dollars.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), what is the most the company may charge me for one inspection, in Singapore dollars` `s 138(3) a creditor of the company` `s 138(3) the register of charges` EQUALS JUST 0      -- "without fee"
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), what is the most the company may charge me for one inspection, in Singapore dollars` `s 138(3) any other person` `s 138(3) the register of charges` EQUALS JUST 2      -- "not exceeding $2"
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), what is the most the company may charge me for one inspection, in Singapore dollars` `s 138(3) any other person` `s 138(3) the instruments or copies kept under section 138` EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under section 138(3): is the fee the company has fixed for one inspection within the limit.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), is the fee the company has fixed for one inspection within the limit` `s 138(3) any other person` `s 138(3) the register of charges` 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- $2 is within the limit
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), is the fee the company has fixed for one inspection within the limit` `s 138(3) any other person` `s 138(3) the register of charges` 3 EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- $3 is not
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3), is the fee the company has fixed for one inspection within the limit` `s 138(3) a member of the company` `s 138(3) the register of charges` 1 EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- a member inspects without fee

-- Under section 138(3A): may I be furnished with a copy of the instrument or debenture.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), may I be furnished with a copy of the instrument or debenture` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), may I be furnished with a copy of the instrument or debenture` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING      -- fee not paid (fork F-K15)
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), may I be furnished with a copy of the instrument or debenture` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING      -- no application

-- Under section 138(3A): what is the last day for the company to furnish me with the copy.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), what is the last day for the company to furnish me with the copy` (Date 10 5 2026) EQUALS Date 13 5 2026      -- 3 days after 10 May
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), what is the last day for the company to furnish me with the copy` (Date 30 12 2026) EQUALS Date 2 1 2027      -- across the year end

-- Under section 138(3A): what is the most the company may charge for the copy, in Singapore dollars.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), what is the most the company may charge for the copy, in Singapore dollars` 7 EQUALS 7      -- $1 for every page or part
#ASSERT `Under section 138(3A), what is the most the company may charge for the copy, in Singapore dollars` 0 EQUALS 0

-- Under section 138(4): am I guilty of the offence of default in complying with section 138.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(4), am I guilty of the offence of default in complying with section 138` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- an officer in default
#ASSERT `Under section 138(4), am I guilty of the offence of default in complying with section 138` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- not in default (split site (i))
#ASSERT `Under section 138(4), am I guilty of the offence of default in complying with section 138` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- no default

-- Under section 138(4): what is the most I can be fined for default in complying with section 138, in Singapore dollars.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(4), what is the most I can be fined for default in complying with section 138, in Singapore dollars` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST 2000
#ASSERT `Under section 138(4), what is the most I can be fined for default in complying with section 138, in Singapore dollars` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

