#ASSERT `Under section 387B(3), is a document treated as sent to a person not less than the specified number of days before the meeting` TRUE 14 (Date 31 3 2025) (Date 16 3 2025) TRUE (Date 17 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- published only from 17 March: not "beginning before" the latest day (fork F-387B-3).
#ASSERT `Under section 387B(3), is a document treated as sent to a person not less than the specified number of days before the meeting` TRUE 14 (Date 31 3 2025) (Date 17 3 2025) TRUE (Date 17 3 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not treated as sent under subsection (2) at all.
#ASSERT `Under section 387B(3), is a document treated as sent to a person not less than the specified number of days before the meeting` FALSE 14 (Date 31 3 2025) (Date 10 3 2025) TRUE (Date 17 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING

